#. ~ Description of gun mod "sawn-off stock"
#. ~ Description of "sawn-off stock"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/stock.json
msgid ""
"A quick saw cut removed the original stock from this weapon.  It is now much "
"harder to handle, but much smaller."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of gun mod "pistol stock"
#. ~ Description of "pistol stock"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/stock.json
msgid ""
"An add-on stock for handguns, this considerably improves control of recoil."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of gun mod "cheek pad"
#. ~ Description of "cheek pad"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/stock.json
msgid ""
"A stock accessory for sniper rifles and DMRs, this considerably improves eye "
"relief efficiency, prevents slipping, and reduces recoil to the neck and "
"cheek."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of gun mod "butt hook"
#. ~ Description of "butt hook"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/stock.json
msgid ""
"An attachment to the butt of the gun that is held under the armpit, improving"
" stability."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of gun mod "tail hook stock"
#. ~ Description of "tail hook stock"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/stock.json
msgid ""
"A foldable add-on stock for handguns and submachine guns with a pivoting hook"
" that latches onto the forearm, allowing for greater stability."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of gun mod "under folding stock"
#. ~ Description of "under folding stock"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/stock.json
msgid ""
"A light wire-framed stock with a push button release catch on the side  which"
" allows it to fold and be stored away under the weapon's receiver.  The wire "
"construction means that it's less comfortable to shoulder than a regular "
"fixed attachment.  The stock is currently locked in the open position."
msgstr ""

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "under folding stock"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/stock.json
msgid "You push in the release catch on the side and fold away the stock."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of gun mod "under-folding stock (folded)"
#. ~ Description of "under-folding stock (folded)"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/stock.json
msgid ""
"A light wire-framed stock with a push button release catch on the side  which"
" allows it to fold and be stored away under the weapon's receiver.  It is "
"currently folded underneath the weapon's chassis, making it more difficult to"
" control."
msgstr ""

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "integral folding mechanism"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/stock.json
msgid ""
"You tug down on the trigger guard whilst swinging the barrel assembly up and "
"over onto the receiver, locking it into place by the buttplate."
msgstr ""

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "integral folding mechanism (folded))"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/stock.json
msgid ""
"You release the barrel and pivot it forwards, locking it in the open firing "
"position."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of gun mod "MASS compatible stock"
#. ~ Description of "MASS compatible stock"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/stock.json
msgid ""
"A specially designed adjustable stock with an integrated grip to convert the "
"M26-MASS to a standalone configuration."
msgstr ""

