"Bipods are commonly used on rifles and machine guns to provide a forward rest"
" and reduce motion.  Although they greatly improve handling of recoil, they "
"are usable only on certain surfaces (or from the prone position).  This one "
"is integrated into a high end hand guard, replacing the factory hand guard of"
" your weapon, allowing for comfortable shooting with or without the bipod "
"deployed.  Currently the bipod legs are out and are ready for use."
