#. ~ Description of gun mod "high end hand guard"
#. ~ Description of "high end hand guard"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/underbarrel.json
msgid ""
"A comfortable, high end hand guard with a set of optional mounts for "
"accessories and equipment.  When installed, this replaces the original "
"factory hand guard for the weapon, cutting down on excessive rails and "
"weight.  This allows for comfortable, controlled firing of the weapon while "
"keeping a sleek profile and avoiding bulky foregrips."
msgstr ""

